<Positioned left="66" top="52"><Text fontSize="34" color="#F5F8FCFF" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">One hole per year</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="91"><Text fontSize="15" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">When each year's hole was largest, and how large</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="116.94"><Text fontSize="12" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Every year the hole opens in late August, peaks in September or October, and closes when the polar vortex breaks down. What changed is the size of the peak, not the calendar.</Text></Positioned>
